Short:        Draws color spectrum
Author:       walternn@rupert.informatik.uni-stuttgart.de (Norman Walter)
Uploader:     walternn rupert informatik uni-stuttgart de (Norman Walter)
Type:         dev/src
Version:      1.02
Replaces:     Spectrum.lha
Requires:     C Compiler (e.g. StormC, gcc)
Architecture: m68k-amigaos

Approximates spectral lines using gaussian error distribution curves.
This makes it possible to get the rgb values of a certain wave length.

The sourcecode also shows how to use the AmigaOS function ObtainBestPen().
